{"strongs": "H4584", "word": "מָעוֺן", "translit": "ma.on", "root": "עול", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name", "gloss": "in Judah", "definition": "II. מָעוֺן proper name 1. location in Judah Josh 15:55 ( P ), 1Sam 25:2 ( ᵐ5 Μααν , Μαων ), now Ma`în ( Buhl Geogr. 163 and references ), 8 miles south of Hebron; hence ׳ מִדְבַּר מ 1Sam 23:24 ; 1Sam 23:25 (twice in verse), so read also 1Sam 25:1 (for ᵑ0 פארן ) ᵐ5 Th We Dr Bu Klo Kit Löhr; compare 2. masculine in Judah 1Chr 2:45 (twice in verse), ᵐ5 Μεων , Μαων . 3. of a people Judg 10:12 named with Sidonians and Amalek as ancient foes of Israel; possibly intended by writer as = מְעוּנִים q. v.; many read מִדְיָן ( ᵐ5 B A ᵐ5 L Μαδιαμ ); see GFM . — מְעוֺן see בֵּית בַּעַל מְעוֺן ; 1Chr 4:41 see מְעוּנִים .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5889')\">BDB5889</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4584')\">H4584</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5888')\">BDB5888</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5890')\">BDB5890</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>מָעוֺן</bdbheb> <b>proper name</b> <div class=\"point\"><b>1. location</b> <highlightword>in Judah</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Josh 15:55\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"55\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"55\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,55)\">Josh 15:55</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,2)\">1Sam 25:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Μααν</grk>, <grk>Μαων</grk>), now <highlight>Ma`în</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 163 and references</sup></lookup>), 8 miles south of Hebron; hence <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִדְבַּר מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,23,24)\">1Sam 23:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:25\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"25\" cEn